<!--
corona-gerboa-artist: the Council's Master of Art (avatar of the Corona).
A member of the Council as a giant jerboa, a bohemian painter (scale 20 vpt, base anatomy with ears forward).
A white and shiny pearl-grey coat with pinkish little cheeks, a pure white belly and bib.
It wears a big soft beret of magenta-pink cloth/velvet (#ff8ad8, the heraldic colour of the Artist)
tilted coquettishly over the left ear with a central cabillou stalk,
a digital sculpting stylus/brush in fine wood tucked into the edge of the beret with its tip
dripping with bright fluorescent cyan colour (#00f5ff glow),
and an elegant flounced collar with a soft magenta-pink artist's scarf knotted on the chest.
Box: 1.6 × 2.2 × 2.1 tiles, 32 × 44 × 42 voxels, 20 voxels per tile (vpt: 20).
Role: npc.
-->
